    "['mpls-tp meg [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls oam', 'parent_command': ['policy-map [parameter1]', 'class [parameter1]', 'service-policy [parameter1]'], 'root': 'policy-map [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Cisco equivalent command for the HUAWEI `mpls-tp meg test` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nmpls oam\\nmpls oam meg test\\nmpls oam l2vc peer 3.3.3.3 vcid 30000 mep domain 1 service 1\\nmpls oam cc interval 1s\\nmpls oam cc send enable\\nmpls oam cc receive enable\\nmpls oam loss dual-end\\n##\\n\\nNote: The Cisco implementation has some differences in structure and terminology:\\n1. Cisco uses separate `mpls oam` hierarchy commands\\n2. The MEP configuration is split into domain/service identifiers\\n3. The CC interval needs to be explicitly set (default might differ)\\n4. The L2VC configuration is combined with the MEP definition\", 'trans_template': 'mpls oam'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls oam meg test', 'parent_command': ['policy-map [parameter1]', 'class [parameter1]', 'service-policy [parameter1]'], 'root': 'policy-map [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Cisco equivalent command for the HUAWEI `mpls-tp meg test` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nmpls oam\\nmpls oam meg test\\nmpls oam l2vc peer 3.3.3.3 vcid 30000 mep domain 1 service 1\\nmpls oam cc interval 1s\\nmpls oam cc send enable\\nmpls oam cc receive enable\\nmpls oam loss dual-end\\n##\\n\\nNote: The Cisco implementation has some differences in structure and terminology:\\n1. Cisco uses separate `mpls oam` hierarchy commands\\n2. The MEP configuration is split into domain/service identifiers\\n3. The CC interval needs to be explicitly set (default might differ)\\n4. The L2VC configuration is combined with the MEP definition\", 'trans_template': 'mpls oam meg test'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls oam l2vc peer 3.3.3.3 vcid 30000 mep domain 1 service 1', 'parent_command': ['policy-map [param